# ==============================================================================
# 99-devops.conf - Managed by Ansible (setup_pc.yml)
# Process and File Limits for Containers and High-Throughput Dev Tools
# ==============================================================================

# User limits for open file descriptors (prevents "too many open files")
*               soft    nofile          65536
*               hard    nofile          65536
root            soft    nofile          65536
root            hard    nofile          65536

# User limits for max processes / threads
*               soft    nproc           65536
*               hard    nproc           65536
root            soft    nproc           65536
root            hard    nproc           65536
